# Clearing House Phase-2 gate

Runtime key: `CREW_MISSION_CLEARING_HOUSE_MIN_MISSION_LEVEL` (default **`0` = uit**).

## Do not enable yet when

- Prod has little/no Tier 2–3 or Blackout (`territory_blackout_push`) run telemetry
- Top crews are still around `missionLevel` 1
- User has not explicitly asked to turn the gate on

## Enable (set to `3`) only when

- User asks to enable Phase-2 / Clearing House mission-level gate, **or**
- There is solid T2/T3 + Blackout telemetry (multiple runs, no speedup/exploit red flags) **and** the user confirms

Prefer enabling via **Admin → Crew Missions** toggle (runtime key), not by changing code defaults.

Never flip the default in code from `0` to `3` without that confirmation. Docs: `docs/module-protocols/crew-missions.md`, `docs/game-systems/CREW_MISSION_CLEARING_HOUSE_VAULT_2026-04-26.md`.
